  "notes": [
    "Two performances only (2025-04-13 12:30 and 17:00); event, not a regular 公演. Template = night (17:00); day differs in blocks B/C (see day_variant).",
    "Song order locked from 3 independent fan texts (fan report, polyhedra, ameblo/asukyann). Official site publishes no setlist for this event.",
    "MC positions: ameblo gives them for the day show; night is confirmed by fan text for intro, 6th-gen MC after M10, and all-member MC after M16. Others are provisional.",
    "Everything is sung live; several songs are seated or have live instruments (3-2, MIKA). Expect quiet acoustic bands and longer talk.",
    "Skip translating song lyrics; song titles spoken in talk use the romaji here.",
    "Talk dur_s are rough guesses (no grade anchor).",
    "Overture matched the regular-stage overture (HKT48 ver.) by audio comparison with other LODs; the day list names it too.",
    "Hakata Keionbu (Kari) = the members' band (Kojina Yui, Toyonaga Aki, Akiyoshi Yuka, Sakamoto Erena); talk about 3-2 refers to it."
  ],
